WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.430
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.700 --> 01:48.020
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.090 --> 01:51.060
[Episode 17]

4
01:51.289 --> 01:54.190
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

5
01:58.090 --> 01:59.000
Have one.

6
01:59.930 --> 02:01.590
I just can't get over it.

7
02:01.850 --> 02:03.090
If he has plans with someone else,

8
02:03.090 --> 02:05.090
why did he wait for me to get off work?

9
02:05.450 --> 02:07.730
Didn't they say there's a pervert around?

10
02:07.730 --> 02:08.840
He was worried about you,

11
02:08.840 --> 02:10.440
so he wanted to walk you home.

12
02:10.460 --> 02:12.060
Who asked for his concern?

13
02:12.900 --> 02:13.750
I finally

14
02:13.750 --> 02:15.090
strengthened my emotional armor.

15
02:15.090 --> 02:15.740
But he...

16
02:15.960 --> 02:16.820
As soon as I saw him,

17
02:16.820 --> 02:18.230
it... it collapsed.

18
02:20.090 --> 02:21.360
If he'd just ignored me

19
02:21.360 --> 02:22.250
from beginning to end,

20
02:22.250 --> 02:24.150
I might've moved on long ago.

21
02:24.300 --> 02:25.690
That's not how it works.

22
02:26.030 --> 02:27.240
If he didn't come to you,

23
02:27.240 --> 02:28.560
you'd be moping again.

24
02:30.480 --> 02:32.480
Ugh, I don't know what to do with him.

25
02:38.860 --> 02:39.650
You see,

26
02:39.960 --> 02:41.360
he dressed up so nicely

27
02:41.500 --> 02:42.690
and even ordered flowers.

28
02:42.690 --> 02:43.340
After work,

29
02:43.340 --> 02:44.690
he should've just gone on his date.

30
02:44.690 --> 02:45.530
Why did he wait for me?

31
02:45.530 --> 02:46.430
Does he pity me?

32
02:49.060 --> 02:49.650
Am I,

33
02:49.650 --> 02:51.530
Yun Li, someone

34
02:51.530 --> 02:52.900
at his beck and call?

35
02:53.740 --> 02:54.530
You are.

36
02:55.240 --> 02:55.710
Tang Lin,

37
02:55.710 --> 02:57.460
whose side are you on?

38
02:58.090 --> 02:59.250
Alright, Lili.

39
02:59.300 --> 03:00.250
I'm 100% on your side,

40
03:00.250 --> 03:01.430
of course.

41
03:01.530 --> 03:02.500
But seriously,

42
03:02.530 --> 03:03.740
haven't you considered

43
03:03.740 --> 03:05.940
you might be the one he wanted to ask out?

44
03:07.410 --> 03:08.610
How's that possible?

45
03:08.630 --> 03:09.690
They said that woman

46
03:09.690 --> 03:10.750
has known him for years.

47
03:10.750 --> 03:11.960
How could it be me?

48
03:13.300 --> 03:14.130
Huh?

49
03:14.130 --> 03:15.800
That was what others said.

50
03:15.930 --> 03:17.530
You have to ask him in person.

51
03:17.960 --> 03:19.690
I've been chasing him for so long,

52
03:19.690 --> 03:20.820
and he kept rejecting me.

53
03:20.820 --> 03:22.880
He refused every time I asked him out.

54
03:25.650 --> 03:27.870
Besides, he hasn't reached out to me

55
03:27.870 --> 03:29.090
for so long.

56
03:29.240 --> 03:30.180
I bet he doesn't even know

57
03:30.180 --> 03:31.510
I deleted him on WeChat.

58
03:32.090 --> 03:33.820
You even deleted him on WeChat?

59
03:36.860 --> 03:37.630
You two still

60
03:37.630 --> 03:39.090
work in the same company.

61
03:39.090 --> 03:40.630
Interactions are inevitable.

62
03:40.630 --> 03:42.090
Isn't it awkward?

63
03:43.130 --> 03:45.190
Actually, I regret it a little bit.

64
03:45.960 --> 03:47.500
Should I add him back?

65
03:47.960 --> 03:50.150
He probably didn't even notice.

66
03:52.750 --> 03:53.860
But what if he did?

67
03:53.860 --> 03:55.590
Wouldn't that be more awkward?

68
03:55.800 --> 03:56.590
Forget it.

69
03:57.640 --> 03:58.630
Actually, for you two,

70
03:58.630 --> 04:01.030
having clear boundaries isn't a bad thing.

71
04:01.030 --> 04:02.250
There are plenty of good men around.

72
04:02.250 --> 04:02.860
There's no need

73
04:02.860 --> 04:04.300
to pine away for one guy.

74
04:08.560 --> 04:09.840
In that case, are you still

75
04:09.840 --> 04:11.570
going to that hot spring hotel?

76
04:11.740 --> 04:13.000
What hot spring hotel?

77
04:13.620 --> 04:15.460
The year-end party Xia invited us to.

78
04:15.460 --> 04:16.450
I wonder if

79
04:16.450 --> 04:17.430
Fu Shize will go.

80
04:17.540 --> 04:18.660
But if you don't want to go...

81
04:18.660 --> 04:20.240
I didn't say I wouldn't go.

82
04:20.430 --> 04:22.040
Am I that petty?

83
04:24.360 --> 04:25.560
You said it yourself—

84
04:25.560 --> 04:27.860
it's just normal interaction between colleagues.

85
04:27.860 --> 04:29.540
What's wrong with colleagues going on

86
04:29.540 --> 04:30.870
a team-building event?

87
04:30.890 --> 04:31.690
It's fine.

88
04:31.830 --> 04:32.630
I'll just ask Xia

89
04:32.630 --> 04:33.430
to invite two single

90
04:33.430 --> 04:34.560
colleagues to join us...

91
04:34.560 --> 04:35.300
No!

92
04:35.890 --> 04:37.490
If you bring them, I won't go.

93
04:52.470 --> 04:52.970
Yun Ye,

94
04:53.230 --> 04:54.760
I'm so done with you.

95
04:55.010 --> 04:57.010
Report to me as soon as class is over.

96
05:10.990 --> 05:11.800
Hey, Li.

97
05:11.950 --> 05:12.950
Don't tell me

98
05:12.950 --> 05:14.570
you just saw my text.

99
05:15.420 --> 05:16.280
I've been busy.

100
05:16.340 --> 05:18.620
I had consecutive exams in Chinese, English,

101
05:18.620 --> 05:20.090
and Physics just days ago.

102
05:20.620 --> 05:22.500
I barely have any brain cells left.

103
05:22.500 --> 05:23.560
You're so busy,

104
05:23.660 --> 05:25.990
yet you still have time to send postcards?

105
05:27.370 --> 05:28.610
Wait, how do you know?

106
05:28.980 --> 05:31.180
Her brother came to me

107
05:31.180 --> 05:32.010
just to ask if

108
05:32.010 --> 05:33.570
you were the one sending his sister

109
05:33.570 --> 05:34.560
postcards.

110
05:34.620 --> 05:35.659
Sending them every week,

111
05:35.659 --> 05:37.310
you're quite persistent, huh?

112
05:37.310 --> 05:38.120
Wait,

113
05:38.810 --> 05:40.270
how did her brother know

114
05:40.270 --> 05:41.120
it was me?

115
05:41.800 --> 05:43.180
Ten postcards,

116
05:43.450 --> 05:45.770
all with the exact same handwriting.

117
05:45.890 --> 05:47.220
What were you thinking?

118
05:48.690 --> 05:50.290
Her brother read my letters?

119
05:50.870 --> 05:51.810
I also think

120
05:51.830 --> 05:53.120
he read your letters.

121
05:53.659 --> 05:56.420
No way, that's too shameless.

122
05:56.680 --> 05:57.620
It is, a little.

123
05:58.480 --> 05:59.370
But Yun Ye,

124
05:59.370 --> 05:59.950
what if

125
05:59.950 --> 06:00.480
this

126
06:00.480 --> 06:02.220
affects the girl's grades?

127
06:02.420 --> 06:03.480
You still need to, you know,

128
06:03.480 --> 06:04.570
tone it down a bit.

129
06:05.270 --> 06:06.120
No, no, no.

130
06:06.120 --> 06:06.860
Yun Li,

131
06:06.990 --> 06:08.920
your brother's letters were read,

132
06:09.060 --> 06:10.660
and you won't stand up for me?

133
06:10.660 --> 06:11.450
Yun Ye,

134
06:11.800 --> 06:12.750
prolonged one-sided giving

135
06:12.750 --> 06:14.750
is a recipe for hurt and heartbreak.

136
06:14.920 --> 06:16.750
You need to love yourself more, you know?

137
06:16.750 --> 06:17.360
Wait,

138
06:17.360 --> 06:18.450
how am I hurt?

139
06:18.500 --> 06:19.920
She tutored me in math,

140
06:19.950 --> 06:21.480
so my grades even improved.

141
06:22.800 --> 06:23.360
Li,

142
06:23.360 --> 06:25.220
why are you suddenly saying this?

143
06:26.620 --> 06:27.560
It's just advice

144
06:27.560 --> 06:29.690
from someone who's been there.

145
06:31.580 --> 06:33.870
That guy doesn't like you?

146
06:35.950 --> 06:37.880
Let's go back to talking about you.

147
06:38.560 --> 06:40.750
I think her family doesn't plan to interfere,

148
06:40.750 --> 06:42.600
as long as it doesn't affect her studies.

149
06:42.600 --> 06:43.250
He just

150
06:43.250 --> 06:44.580
came to me to confirm it.

151
06:45.030 --> 06:46.430
Does that mean I can

152
06:46.450 --> 06:47.620
keep sending postcards?

153
06:47.620 --> 06:49.630
I don't support teenage dating.

154
06:51.390 --> 06:53.800
If there's nothing else, I'll hang up.

155
06:53.800 --> 06:54.500
Bye.

156
07:05.740 --> 07:06.740
Let me do it, Lili.

157
07:07.600 --> 07:08.390
Thanks.

158
07:08.830 --> 07:10.430
Yesterday, I saw a drone

159
07:10.430 --> 07:11.360
in your video.

160
07:11.390 --> 07:12.560
Is it for my uncle?

161
07:14.190 --> 07:15.000
Yes,

162
07:15.430 --> 07:17.430
but I'm not giving it to him anymore.

163
07:18.490 --> 07:20.060
Did you have a fight?

164
07:20.430 --> 07:21.240
No.

165
07:21.630 --> 07:23.330
I just don't want to anymore.

166
07:23.930 --> 07:25.250
Did Uncle do something

167
07:25.250 --> 07:27.100
to upset you?

168
07:29.300 --> 07:30.100
Yun Li.

169
07:30.600 --> 07:31.500
Qingsong, hang on.

170
07:31.500 --> 07:31.890
I still

171
07:31.890 --> 07:33.550
have something to say to Lili.

172
07:40.060 --> 07:40.890
Fu Zhengchu,

173
07:41.770 --> 07:43.770
is there a woman who your uncle has

174
07:43.800 --> 07:44.950
known for a long time

175
07:45.250 --> 07:47.000
and is very close to?

176
07:47.890 --> 07:48.690
Lili,

177
07:48.930 --> 07:50.750
do you think Uncle

178
07:50.930 --> 07:52.130
likes someone else?

179
07:52.600 --> 07:54.100
I'm just asking.

180
07:55.360 --> 07:58.070
The only girls and women around him

181
07:58.100 --> 07:59.830
are blood-related

182
07:59.830 --> 08:00.740
relatives.

183
08:01.040 --> 08:01.950
And don't worry.

184
08:01.950 --> 08:02.630
There's no way

185
08:02.630 --> 08:03.830
he likes anyone else.

186
08:04.250 --> 08:05.160
Are you sure?

187
08:05.160 --> 08:06.100
Of course.

188
08:08.030 --> 08:08.830
Uncle!

189
08:15.570 --> 08:16.130
Uncle.

190
08:16.190 --> 08:17.190
What drinks did you get?

191
08:17.190 --> 08:17.950
I want one.

192
08:18.690 --> 08:19.500
Get in.

193
08:21.430 --> 08:22.930
Do you have to be so stingy?

194
08:24.160 --> 08:25.220
Let's get in, Lili.

195
08:39.530 --> 08:40.460
Chocolate milk.

196
08:41.789 --> 08:43.600
No thanks. I'll just have water.

197
08:46.550 --> 08:47.700
Is everyone here?

198
08:47.940 --> 08:49.050
Let's set off then.

199
08:53.200 --> 08:54.400
What's wrong, Yun Li?

200
08:56.600 --> 08:57.650
Mr. Xu, your clothes

201
08:57.650 --> 08:59.050
are quite fancy.

202
09:00.550 --> 09:01.360
Are they?

203
09:02.050 --> 09:03.290
They look good on you.

204
09:05.440 --> 09:06.360
I've always thought

205
09:06.360 --> 09:08.550
Shize dresses too plainly.

206
09:08.650 --> 09:09.750
I tried giving him some clothes,

207
09:09.750 --> 09:11.100
but he refused them all.

208
09:11.120 --> 09:12.200
Why?

209
09:12.960 --> 09:14.960
Because Uncle thinks they're ugly.

210
09:17.030 --> 09:18.690
Will it kill you to stay quiet?

211
09:19.030 --> 09:20.050
Just drive.

212
09:20.460 --> 09:21.500
We're off.

213
09:39.530 --> 09:40.790
This place looks nice.

214
09:40.960 --> 09:42.550
Yeah? Does it meet your standards?

215
09:42.550 --> 09:44.250
My bro does have good taste.

216
09:50.030 --> 09:51.550
I... I can do it myself.

217
09:58.070 --> 09:58.780
Tangy, Xia.

218
09:58.810 --> 10:00.810
Lili, why are you so late?

219
10:01.480 --> 10:01.840
I...

220
10:01.840 --> 10:02.790
Where are the rest?

221
10:02.790 --> 10:04.100
They're right behind.

222
10:05.890 --> 10:06.470
Lili,

223
10:06.500 --> 10:07.610
you're so fast!

224
10:08.200 --> 10:08.740
Lili,

225
10:08.740 --> 10:09.940
let me introduce you.

226
10:09.940 --> 10:11.360
This is Chen Renran,

227
10:11.360 --> 10:12.360
my college classmate.

228
10:12.360 --> 10:13.960
He works in semiconductors.

229
10:14.150 --> 10:15.050
Hello, Yun Li.

230
10:15.940 --> 10:16.740
Hello.

231
10:16.940 --> 10:18.050
This is Lu Yu.

232
10:18.150 --> 10:19.130
He works in AI;

233
10:19.130 --> 10:20.290
also my college classmate.

234
10:20.290 --> 10:21.100
Hello.

235
10:23.630 --> 10:24.490
This is my brother,

236
10:24.490 --> 10:25.070
Fu Zhengchu,

237
10:25.070 --> 10:26.670
currently studying at NUST.

238
10:27.440 --> 10:28.290
Wow,

239
10:28.340 --> 10:29.340
an elite student!

240
10:30.480 --> 10:31.530
No, not at all.

241
10:32.390 --> 10:33.610
Don't praise him.

242
10:33.640 --> 10:35.380
It'll go straight to his head.

243
10:37.210 --> 10:38.710
Lili's the amazing one.

244
10:38.740 --> 10:40.150
She's a content creator on EAW,

245
10:40.150 --> 10:41.460
with tons of followers.

246
10:41.460 --> 10:42.250
Tangy, stop it.

247
10:42.250 --> 10:43.000
Really?

248
10:43.000 --> 10:44.100
I'm on EAW a lot.

249
10:44.130 --> 10:44.960
What's your username?

250
10:44.960 --> 10:45.890
I'll follow you.

251
10:46.600 --> 10:48.240
I... um...

252
10:48.240 --> 10:49.030
Excuse me.

253
11:00.440 --> 11:01.240
Let's go.

254
11:01.390 --> 11:02.950
I'll help you with your luggage.

255
11:02.950 --> 11:04.010
I'll see you later.

256
11:05.960 --> 11:07.760
This is my brother, Xu Qingsong.

257
11:07.790 --> 11:08.930
Hello.

258
11:09.940 --> 11:10.750
Let's go too.

259
11:10.750 --> 11:11.280
Let's go.

260
11:11.340 --> 11:11.870
Let's go.

261
11:11.910 --> 11:12.370
Go!

262
11:25.930 --> 11:26.720
Thanks.

263
11:31.240 --> 11:32.030
Lili!

264
11:41.600 --> 11:42.390
Lili.

265
11:43.790 --> 11:46.270
Why didn't you tell me there were other people?

266
11:46.270 --> 11:47.820
Those are Xia's friends.

267
11:48.360 --> 11:50.050
They happen to be returning to Nanwu,

268
11:50.050 --> 11:52.410
so we just... came together.

269
11:54.290 --> 11:55.000
On their own,

270
11:55.000 --> 11:56.860
they're nice, clean-cut guys.

271
11:57.130 --> 11:58.440
But compared to the three

272
11:58.440 --> 11:59.270
you came with,

273
11:59.270 --> 12:00.960
they do fall a bit short.

274
12:02.440 --> 12:03.320
But...

275
12:03.630 --> 12:05.010
While good looks are a gift,

276
12:05.010 --> 12:06.500
good character is a choice.

277
12:06.500 --> 12:07.720
Don't just judge them

278
12:07.720 --> 12:08.920
by their appearance.

279
12:09.550 --> 12:10.250
What did you

280
12:10.250 --> 12:11.200
tell them?

281
12:13.630 --> 12:15.960
I only said you were single.

282
12:17.600 --> 12:18.390
I...

283
12:21.340 --> 12:22.430
Lili,

284
12:22.720 --> 12:24.520
I'm doing this for your own good.

285
12:25.000 --> 12:25.750
You can't

286
12:25.750 --> 12:26.960
put all your eggs in one basket.

287
12:26.960 --> 12:28.030
You should get out there

288
12:28.030 --> 12:29.200
and meet other guys.

289
12:29.840 --> 12:30.630
It might

290
12:30.630 --> 12:31.840
help you move on from

291
12:31.840 --> 12:33.770
the whole situation with Fu Shize.

292
12:34.740 --> 12:35.530
Lili!

293
12:36.840 --> 12:38.000
Am I right?

294
12:38.600 --> 12:39.390
Yes.

295
12:44.440 --> 12:44.890
What year

296
12:44.890 --> 12:46.690
of college did we play this game?

297
12:47.090 --> 12:48.020
Sophomore year?

298
12:48.250 --> 12:49.510
End of sophomore year.

299
12:49.770 --> 12:50.270
Right.

300
12:50.300 --> 12:52.390
He even missed his assignment deadline.

301
12:52.390 --> 12:53.000
Yun Li!

302
12:53.540 --> 12:54.080
Sit here.

303
12:54.220 --> 12:54.750
You're here.

304
12:54.750 --> 12:56.150
It's okay. I'll sit here.

305
13:00.410 --> 13:01.050
I'm asking Uncle

306
13:01.050 --> 13:02.310
when he's coming over.

307
13:04.930 --> 13:05.660
-Tangy. -Hi.

308
13:07.600 --> 13:08.600
I saved you a seat.

309
13:08.600 --> 13:09.340
Sit here.

310
13:13.050 --> 13:13.860
Have a drink.

311
13:14.240 --> 13:15.390
Why are you sitting there?

312
13:15.390 --> 13:16.890
I sit wherever I want.

313
13:16.960 --> 13:18.490
It's none of your business.

314
13:40.270 --> 13:41.120
Uncle.

315
13:42.030 --> 13:42.890
Looking good.

316
13:42.960 --> 13:44.200
Qingsong's clothes actually

317
13:44.200 --> 13:45.460
suit you so well.

318
13:48.000 --> 13:49.800
I don't have a change of clothes.

319
13:51.840 --> 13:52.890
Stop staring.

320
14:04.630 --> 14:05.440
Lili,

321
14:05.440 --> 14:06.130
this sofa is huge.

322
14:06.130 --> 14:08.060
Why are you suddenly so close to me?

323
14:08.840 --> 14:11.860
I feel more at ease next to you.

324
14:16.530 --> 14:17.340
So?

325
14:17.530 --> 14:19.390
Any idea what we should play?

326
14:19.940 --> 14:21.250
I just unboxed a new game:

327
14:21.250 --> 14:22.360
Halli Galli.

328
14:22.840 --> 14:23.650
This is fun.

329
14:23.740 --> 14:26.000
It tests your reflexes. Super exciting.

330
14:26.340 --> 14:27.390
What are the rules?

331
14:27.390 --> 14:28.550
The rules are simple.

332
14:28.550 --> 14:30.200
Everyone takes turns flipping a card.

333
14:30.200 --> 14:31.030
Once there are

334
14:31.030 --> 14:32.530
five of the same fruit on the table,

335
14:32.530 --> 14:33.940
you have to ring the bell.

336
14:34.390 --> 14:35.310
The last to ring the bell

337
14:35.310 --> 14:37.220
has to give everyone else a card.

338
14:37.440 --> 14:38.240
In the end,

339
14:38.240 --> 14:39.750
the one with the most cards wins.

340
14:39.750 --> 14:40.550
Wait!

341
14:43.630 --> 14:44.630
I want to sit here.

342
14:44.650 --> 14:46.580
Why did you suddenly change seats?

343
14:46.960 --> 14:49.290
I'm... afraid you'll cheat.

344
14:49.290 --> 14:50.150
I'll watch you.

345
14:50.360 --> 14:51.550
Are you serious?

346
14:51.840 --> 14:53.500
How can you cheat in this game?

347
14:54.240 --> 14:55.100
I don't care.

348
14:55.700 --> 14:56.500
Let's start.

349
14:57.390 --> 14:58.100
Yun Li,

350
14:58.240 --> 14:59.700
did you understand the rules?

351
14:59.700 --> 15:01.430
Or should I repeat them for you?

352
15:02.170 --> 15:02.980
Actually...

353
15:03.240 --> 15:04.030
Let's start.

354
15:05.250 --> 15:06.200
Ready?

355
15:06.200 --> 15:07.250
I'll start.

356
15:17.650 --> 15:18.460
Uncle,

357
15:19.030 --> 15:20.150
how are you so fast?

358
15:20.360 --> 15:21.420
Come on, continue.

359
15:23.750 --> 15:24.610
Strawberries!

360
15:34.170 --> 15:35.150
Hey, Chen,

361
15:35.150 --> 15:36.480
you're pretty good too.

362
15:38.870 --> 15:40.010
What do you mean, "Chen"?

363
15:40.010 --> 15:41.070
Are you that close?

364
15:42.140 --> 15:43.400
Oh, shut up.

365
15:44.940 --> 15:45.400
Flip your card.

366
15:45.400 --> 15:46.200
Continue.

367
15:53.760 --> 15:55.330
Ouch! Fu Zhengchu!

368
15:55.360 --> 15:56.580
Do you have to hit so hard?

369
15:56.580 --> 15:57.840
Are you born stubborn?

370
15:58.170 --> 15:59.370
It hurts.

371
16:02.290 --> 16:04.200
What are you two doing?

372
16:11.100 --> 16:12.030
It doesn't hurt.

373
16:14.320 --> 16:15.220
I feel nothing.

374
16:16.700 --> 16:18.900
Is this the famous fight to be the alpha?

375
16:25.380 --> 16:26.000
Come on.

376
16:26.020 --> 16:26.930
Again, again.

377
16:26.960 --> 16:27.460
Go.

378
16:43.750 --> 16:44.500
Lili,

379
16:44.500 --> 16:46.010
you don't have many cards left.

380
16:46.010 --> 16:47.070
You have to step up.

381
16:54.750 --> 16:55.510
Uncle,

382
16:55.510 --> 16:57.100
there aren't five fruits.

383
16:57.100 --> 16:58.910
It's a foul to ring the bell.

384
16:58.910 --> 16:59.910
Take the penalty.

385
17:01.120 --> 17:01.910
My bad.

386
17:04.900 --> 17:05.849
Let's continue.

387
17:06.900 --> 17:07.829
Whose turn is it?

388
17:19.609 --> 17:20.420
Uncle,

389
17:20.609 --> 17:21.660
why are you

390
17:21.660 --> 17:23.119
suddenly so slow to react?

391
17:47.960 --> 17:48.820
Why don't we...

392
17:50.160 --> 17:51.200
play another game?

393
17:51.200 --> 17:51.750
What?

394
17:51.750 --> 17:52.250
I'm finally

395
17:52.250 --> 17:53.310
not the loser.

396
17:53.920 --> 17:55.050
Let's play a bit more.

397
17:55.050 --> 17:55.790
I...

398
17:55.790 --> 17:57.450
Let's switch. Enough of this.

399
17:57.610 --> 17:58.810
Then let's switch.

400
17:58.960 --> 18:00.200
What should we play?

401
18:00.220 --> 18:01.680
Let's play High Card Draw.

402
18:02.010 --> 18:03.640
The person with the highest card

403
18:03.640 --> 18:04.800
can ask

404
18:04.820 --> 18:06.320
anyone here a question.

405
18:06.590 --> 18:08.120
It's simple and thrilling.

406
18:09.000 --> 18:10.950
Well, I brought a bottle of red wine.

407
18:10.950 --> 18:11.740
I'll bring it over

408
18:11.740 --> 18:12.460
to spice things up.

409
18:12.460 --> 18:13.010
Sure.

410
18:13.010 --> 18:13.660
Okay.

411
18:15.200 --> 18:16.290
Put this away.

412
18:21.160 --> 18:21.550
No thanks.

413
18:21.550 --> 18:23.500
I-I'll drink orange juice.

414
18:23.610 --> 18:24.400
It's fine.

415
18:24.400 --> 18:26.600
Hold onto it. You can have a taste later.

416
18:27.660 --> 18:29.350
None for me, thanks.

417
18:30.270 --> 18:30.850
Okay.

418
18:43.610 --> 18:45.010
Then let's start.

419
18:45.400 --> 18:46.510
-Come on. -Okay.

420
18:53.460 --> 18:54.590
No need to look.

421
18:54.850 --> 18:56.180
I'm winning this round.

422
18:56.220 --> 18:58.020
I have the highest card, don't I?

423
18:58.050 --> 18:58.850
I lost.

424
19:00.010 --> 19:01.810
Go on and ask someone a question.

425
19:04.660 --> 19:05.900
Chen,

426
19:06.790 --> 19:07.750
are you single?

427
19:10.610 --> 19:11.420
Yes.

428
19:12.400 --> 19:13.550
Oh, single!

429
19:18.820 --> 19:19.610
Come on.

430
19:19.980 --> 19:20.550
Continue.

431
19:20.550 --> 19:21.090
Another round.

432
19:21.090 --> 19:22.550
Three, two, one!

433
19:22.550 --> 19:24.010
-Ten. -Eight.

434
19:24.460 --> 19:25.090
I got a Q.

435
19:27.920 --> 19:28.750
Then you ask.

436
19:29.660 --> 19:30.460
Yun Li,

437
19:31.220 --> 19:32.090
among

438
19:32.350 --> 19:33.420
everyone here,

439
19:33.750 --> 19:35.480
who are you most interested in?

440
19:48.090 --> 19:48.880
No one.

441
19:49.250 --> 19:50.750
If you have to name one?

442
19:50.960 --> 19:52.620
You can only ask one question.

443
19:54.340 --> 19:55.010
Come on.

444
19:55.010 --> 19:56.200
Another round.

445
19:56.200 --> 19:56.790
Come on.

446
19:56.790 --> 19:57.650
Next round.

447
19:57.680 --> 19:58.140
Come on.

448
20:08.450 --> 20:09.450
Jackpot!

449
20:09.700 --> 20:10.220
Q!

450
20:12.480 --> 20:13.200
He got a K.

451
20:15.330 --> 20:16.720
Finally won a round.

452
20:19.400 --> 20:20.730
Then I'll ask Yun Li too.

453
20:22.740 --> 20:24.940
Among everyone here, who do you think is

454
20:25.900 --> 20:26.900
the best looking?

455
20:30.960 --> 20:31.750
Fu Zhengchu!

456
20:34.790 --> 20:35.550
Me?

457
20:38.240 --> 20:39.440
I'm the best looking?

458
20:52.830 --> 20:53.640
Next round.

459
20:54.250 --> 20:55.050
You all go on.

460
20:55.590 --> 20:56.790
I need to get some air.

461
21:03.980 --> 21:05.740
I suddenly feel a bit tired.

462
21:05.880 --> 21:06.880
I'll go to my room.

463
21:06.900 --> 21:07.730
Have fun.

464
21:08.180 --> 21:09.350
There's a hot spring in the room.

465
21:09.350 --> 21:10.460
You can use it.

466
21:10.500 --> 21:11.420
Lili, what about you?

467
21:11.420 --> 21:12.500
I'll go with you.

468
21:13.140 --> 21:13.670
Let's go.

469
21:13.830 --> 21:15.030
Then I'll go back too.

470
21:15.070 --> 21:15.790
I'll take a bath.

471
21:15.790 --> 21:16.180
Bye.

472
21:16.250 --> 21:16.530
Let's go.

473
21:16.530 --> 21:16.810
Okay.

474
21:16.810 --> 21:17.160
-Bye. -Bye.

475
21:17.160 --> 21:17.830
I'll be going too.

476
21:17.830 --> 21:18.490
Bye!

477
21:18.510 --> 21:19.530
You're leaving too?

478
21:19.530 --> 21:20.420
Bye.

479
21:20.420 --> 21:21.310
See you.

480
21:21.590 --> 21:22.550
The three of us can continue.

481
21:22.550 --> 21:23.210
Let's go on.

482
21:36.250 --> 21:38.380
You really know how to enjoy yourself.

483
21:44.120 --> 21:44.920
What's wrong?

484
21:45.960 --> 21:47.000
In a bad mood?

485
21:48.440 --> 21:49.840
Didn't she always say...

486
21:51.330 --> 21:53.390
I'm better looking than Fu Zhengchu?

487
21:54.700 --> 21:56.630
Is this what's been bothering you?

488
22:02.250 --> 22:03.180
Since when do you

489
22:03.830 --> 22:05.890
care so much about what others think?

490
22:11.940 --> 22:12.850
Do you really think

491
22:12.850 --> 22:14.650
Fu Zhengchu's the best looking?

492
22:15.480 --> 22:17.330
Can you not expose me?

493
22:19.240 --> 22:20.240
I knew

494
22:20.330 --> 22:22.090
your taste wasn't that bad.

495
22:22.900 --> 22:24.030
Then choose again.

496
22:26.330 --> 22:27.400
I choose...

497
22:29.250 --> 22:30.050
Mr. Xu.

498
22:30.500 --> 22:31.760
Think again.

499
22:32.850 --> 22:34.050
I think that Chen guy

500
22:34.050 --> 22:35.070
is decent.

501
22:41.220 --> 22:42.460
Of course,

502
22:43.250 --> 22:45.660
Fu Shize wore a floral shirt today.

503
22:46.180 --> 22:47.610
He did look really good.

504
22:51.790 --> 22:52.530
Don't tell me

505
22:52.530 --> 22:53.850
you're obsessed with him again

506
22:53.850 --> 22:54.460
just because

507
22:54.460 --> 22:55.860
of a stupid floral shirt.

508
22:56.440 --> 22:57.250
I'm not

509
22:57.250 --> 22:58.500
that shallow!

510
22:58.900 --> 23:00.100
That'd better be true!

511
23:00.100 --> 23:00.630
Tang Lin!

512
23:08.270 --> 23:10.220
Do you remember

513
23:11.050 --> 23:13.590
that Fu Shize wanted to ask out

514
23:13.590 --> 23:15.030
a girl he's known

515
23:15.030 --> 23:15.960
for a long time?

516
23:16.480 --> 23:17.140
I remember.

517
23:17.220 --> 23:17.920
Why?

518
23:18.310 --> 23:20.070
But Fu Zhengchu said that people

519
23:20.070 --> 23:21.140
he's known for a long time

520
23:21.140 --> 23:22.380
are all blood relatives.

521
23:22.380 --> 23:23.000
So,

522
23:23.460 --> 23:25.720
did... did I misunderstand him?

523
23:26.530 --> 23:27.850
Even if it was a misunderstanding,

524
23:27.850 --> 23:29.910
he's been rejecting you up until now.

525
23:33.220 --> 23:33.920
Lili.

526
23:34.810 --> 23:35.960
I think that Chen guy

527
23:35.960 --> 23:37.220
is quite fond of you.

528
23:38.350 --> 23:39.570
You need to know

529
23:39.750 --> 23:41.220
that you're very popular.

530
23:41.220 --> 23:42.880
Stop mentioning him.

531
23:43.160 --> 23:44.620
Why don't you just ask him?

532
23:44.670 --> 23:46.090
You're just torturing yourself

533
23:46.090 --> 23:47.390
by dwelling on this.

534
23:48.830 --> 23:50.180
But he's rejected me

535
23:50.180 --> 23:51.220
so many times.

536
23:51.680 --> 23:52.940
Wouldn't asking again

537
23:53.010 --> 23:54.540
just make me look pathetic?

538
24:01.160 --> 24:02.010
Lili,

539
24:02.680 --> 24:03.880
I didn't know

540
24:04.050 --> 24:06.250
you've been hiding such a great figure!

541
24:06.330 --> 24:07.050
Tangy!

542
24:14.460 --> 24:15.220
Who's that?

543
24:18.290 --> 24:18.850
I...

544
24:31.940 --> 24:33.810
Here, have a drink.

545
24:39.980 --> 24:42.510
About the restaurant thing you mentioned...

546
24:44.960 --> 24:46.410
Jiameng told Yun Li?

547
24:53.250 --> 24:56.110
Well, didn't I help you fend off an unwanted suitor?

548
25:02.940 --> 25:04.940
I'm going to die of embarrassment.

549
25:05.430 --> 25:09.360
Oh my gosh, they heard everything.

550
25:13.350 --> 25:15.720
I think you shouldn't overthink it.

551
25:16.020 --> 25:17.370
Maybe they didn't

552
25:17.390 --> 25:18.540
even hear anything.

553
25:19.220 --> 25:21.020
T-They even knocked on the wall.

554
25:22.460 --> 25:23.960
Even if they heard us,

555
25:24.510 --> 25:25.720
it's no big deal.

556
25:25.960 --> 25:27.220
It is a big deal!

557
25:27.220 --> 25:29.480
Oh my gosh, just kill me!

558
25:29.480 --> 25:31.010
I was embarrassing when I was chasing him,

559
25:31.010 --> 25:32.960
and I'm still embarrassing when I'm not chasing him.

560
25:32.960 --> 25:33.880
Gosh,

561
25:33.880 --> 25:35.510
I'm just a huge embarrassment.

562
25:35.510 --> 25:36.310
There, there.

563
25:42.720 --> 25:44.180
Xia asked us to play cards.

564
25:44.460 --> 25:45.750
I'm not going.

565
25:46.570 --> 25:47.830
Then I won't go either.

566
26:51.570 --> 26:52.530
But he's rejected me

567
26:52.530 --> 26:53.510
so many times.

568
26:53.720 --> 26:54.880
Wouldn't asking again

569
26:54.880 --> 26:56.410
just make me look pathetic?

570
28:21.250 --> 28:21.910
Just got up?

571
28:25.180 --> 28:26.840
Wanna have breakfast with me?

572
28:33.440 --> 28:34.900
They're wrapping up soon.

573
28:41.220 --> 28:41.980
Thanks.

574
28:45.810 --> 28:47.340
There's nothing much left.

575
28:54.750 --> 28:55.720
Want some toast?

576
28:55.960 --> 28:57.570
Oh, I can do it myself.

577
28:59.260 --> 29:00.060
Thanks.

578
29:03.850 --> 29:04.850
Take a seat.

579
29:05.050 --> 29:06.110
I'll bring it over.

580
29:06.310 --> 29:07.550
Okay, thanks.

581
29:38.080 --> 29:39.210
What a coincidence.

582
29:40.110 --> 29:41.050
Can I sit here?

583
29:41.050 --> 29:43.610
Fu Shize... is toasting the bread.

584
29:51.010 --> 29:53.550
Are you two in the talking stage?

585
29:59.250 --> 30:00.050
You're late.

586
30:00.070 --> 30:01.050
There's nothing much left.

587
30:01.050 --> 30:01.660
How about

588
30:01.660 --> 30:02.880
I take you out to eat?

589
30:13.180 --> 30:13.980
Thanks.

590
30:14.140 --> 30:15.570
I'll just have the toast.

591
30:26.920 --> 30:27.590
Thanks.

592
30:31.810 --> 30:33.250
I warmed it with boiling water,

593
30:33.250 --> 30:34.250
so it took a while.

594
30:40.310 --> 30:41.920
Just coffee for breakfast?

595
30:41.920 --> 30:42.720
That won't do.

596
30:42.720 --> 30:43.780
H-Here, have this.

597
30:46.520 --> 30:47.070
And this.

598
30:47.070 --> 30:48.110
I didn't touch it.

599
30:52.770 --> 30:53.240
Thanks.

600
31:02.980 --> 31:04.460
I... I forgot my bag.

601
31:04.610 --> 31:05.420
I...

602
31:05.480 --> 31:06.660
Where we just ate?

603
31:07.510 --> 31:08.380
I'll go.

604
31:15.110 --> 31:15.810
Yun Li.

605
31:19.070 --> 31:20.270
Waiting for someone?

606
31:23.010 --> 31:24.500
I just want to confirm this—

607
31:24.500 --> 31:26.930
you're not dating anyone,

608
31:27.250 --> 31:28.050
right?

609
31:30.650 --> 31:31.300
Okay.

610
31:31.810 --> 31:33.270
I'll be straightforward.

611
31:33.580 --> 31:34.840
I'm interested in you.

612
31:35.550 --> 31:36.920
But if you like someone else,

613
31:36.920 --> 31:37.610
or if

614
31:38.250 --> 31:39.460
you're in a relationship,

615
31:39.460 --> 31:40.550
please tell me.

616
31:41.420 --> 31:43.350
Let's not waste each other's time.

617
31:43.720 --> 31:45.180
You and Congsheng's uncle

618
31:45.180 --> 31:46.840
are clearly not just friends.

619
31:47.460 --> 31:49.070
If you're flirting with him

620
31:49.130 --> 31:50.460
just to

621
31:50.490 --> 31:51.070
reject me,

622
31:51.070 --> 31:52.380
it's completely unnecessary.

623
31:52.380 --> 31:53.220
How are we

624
31:53.220 --> 31:54.680
not just friends?

625
31:54.720 --> 31:56.650
What kind of friends act like this?

626
31:58.110 --> 31:58.920
Let's go.

627
32:06.310 --> 32:07.440
What's on your mind?

628
32:09.180 --> 32:09.960
I'm...

629
32:12.590 --> 32:15.120
thinking about how friends should interact.

630
32:16.050 --> 32:18.050
The grove's decorated with lights.

631
32:21.160 --> 32:22.820
They turn it on during dinner.

632
32:25.750 --> 32:26.280
Let's go.

633
32:36.510 --> 32:37.070
Lili,

634
32:37.100 --> 32:38.660
are you really going to stay in?

635
32:38.660 --> 32:39.480
Yeah.

636
32:39.480 --> 32:40.310
I must finish

637
32:40.310 --> 32:41.480
editing this today.

638
32:41.680 --> 32:42.810
I'll get going then.

639
32:43.370 --> 32:43.880
Bye.

640
32:43.880 --> 32:44.740
Go ahead.

641
33:00.880 --> 33:01.740
Upload!

642
33:52.380 --> 33:54.380
The grove's decorated with lights.

643
33:54.460 --> 33:56.120
They turn it on during dinner.

644
34:52.880 --> 34:53.980
Don't catch a cold.

645
34:55.360 --> 34:56.150
You're here.

646
34:57.730 --> 34:59.170
Have you been drinking?

647
35:20.000 --> 35:21.060
Join me for a while.

648
35:43.710 --> 35:45.350
♪ I grew used to ♪

649
35:45.370 --> 35:48.780
♪ Keeping a polite distance ♪

650
35:50.760 --> 35:52.970
♪ Until you came along ♪

651
35:53.160 --> 35:56.740
♪ And messed up all my logic ♪

652
35:58.550 --> 36:00.730
♪ I once thought it through carefully ♪

653
36:00.770 --> 36:05.010
♪ The breath drawn as I lean in on purpose ♪

654
36:06.090 --> 36:07.840
♪ When I stand right beside you ♪

655
36:07.870 --> 36:12.440
♪ Even silence starts to mean something ♪

656
36:14.040 --> 36:16.990
♪ I know those fears ♪

657
36:17.020 --> 36:20.360
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

658
36:21.770 --> 36:24.400
♪ Still I choose to stay ♪

659
36:24.430 --> 36:27.440
♪ On your page ♪

660
36:29.680 --> 36:31.380
♪ It's you ♪

661
36:31.480 --> 36:33.680
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

662
36:33.720 --> 36:34.870
♪ Just you ♪

663
36:34.900 --> 36:37.550
♪ You are the instinct I can't quit ♪

664
36:35.550 --> 36:37.280
Are you not chasing me anymore?

665
36:37.660 --> 36:39.040
♪ It's always you ♪

666
36:39.060 --> 36:41.380
♪ Who bring faded colors back to life ♪

667
36:41.400 --> 36:44.670
♪ And keep me company through the endless night ♪

668
36:45.360 --> 36:46.730
♪ It's you ♪

669
36:46.760 --> 36:48.730
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

670
36:48.760 --> 36:49.980
♪ Just you ♪

671
36:50.010 --> 36:52.980
♪ All my heart defaults to ♪

672
36:53.010 --> 36:53.960
♪ It's always you ♪

673
36:53.970 --> 36:55.050
♪ You warm ♪

674
36:55.080 --> 36:57.760
♪ Every ordinary season ♪

675
36:55.760 --> 36:59.500
Why are you asking me this all of a sudden?

676
36:58.630 --> 37:01.510
♪ It's you ♪

677
37:07.010 --> 37:08.150
Still don't get it?

678
37:11.890 --> 37:13.840
♪ If sometimes ♪

679
37:13.870 --> 37:17.670
♪ You feel discouraged ♪

680
37:17.380 --> 37:19.010
The person they said

681
37:18.930 --> 37:20.930
♪ I'll be behind you ♪

682
37:19.050 --> 37:20.710
you wanted to ask out...

683
37:20.710 --> 37:21.380
Is you.

684
37:20.960 --> 37:24.990
♪ To protect your uneasy past ♪

685
37:26.560 --> 37:28.930
♪ I don't need anyone to prove ♪

686
37:27.260 --> 37:28.460
It's always been you.

687
37:28.960 --> 37:32.440
♪ Whether I win in this adventure ♪

688
37:33.860 --> 37:36.040
♪ Let me draw near again ♪

689
37:33.900 --> 37:35.560
The person I want to ask out...

690
37:36.090 --> 37:40.600
♪ Every little bit of your heart ♪

691
37:38.840 --> 37:39.970
has always been you.

692
37:42.200 --> 37:45.670
♪ I know those fears ♪

693
37:45.700 --> 37:48.600
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

694
37:49.850 --> 37:52.840
♪ Still I choose to stay ♪

695
37:52.860 --> 37:55.440
♪ On this page ♪

696
37:54.280 --> 37:55.510
You're drunk.

697
37:57.360 --> 37:58.130
I'm not.

698
37:57.960 --> 38:00.880
♪ It's you ♪

699
38:00.170 --> 38:00.670
No, no.

700
38:00.670 --> 38:02.550
Y-You just had too much to drink.

701
38:07.300 --> 38:07.880
Fine.

702
38:10.030 --> 38:11.460
If you think I'm drunk,

703
38:13.840 --> 38:14.480
I can say it again

704
38:14.480 --> 38:15.880
when I'm sober tomorrow.

705
38:18.130 --> 38:19.530
I'm going back to my room.

706
38:20.230 --> 38:21.320
This is for you.

707
38:22.940 --> 38:25.270
Can you wait two minutes before you leave?

708
38:25.590 --> 38:26.990
I came out alone.

709
38:29.520 --> 38:30.040
Yeah.

710
38:42.070 --> 38:43.530
When you wake up tomorrow,

711
38:44.530 --> 38:46.530
will what you just said still count?

712
38:50.360 --> 38:51.170
It will.

713
38:55.380 --> 38:56.840
Then can you stop drinking

714
38:56.840 --> 38:58.110
the rest of your wine?

715
39:02.680 --> 39:03.210
Mm.

716
39:07.170 --> 39:08.280
I'm taking it.

717
39:24.720 --> 39:26.890
Did... Didn't you say

718
39:26.920 --> 39:28.850
you don't have a change of clothes?

719
39:34.030 --> 39:35.030
You said...

720
39:36.780 --> 39:38.830
Xu Qingsong dresses better.

721
39:39.170 --> 39:42.440
You wore it for me?

722
39:47.260 --> 39:48.010
Good night.

723
41:08.260 --> 41:09.050
Not bad.

724
41:09.650 --> 41:11.580
You only drank half a bottle today.

725
41:24.050 --> 41:24.980
Where did you go?

726
41:25.460 --> 41:26.260
To confess.

727
41:28.170 --> 41:29.100
To confess?

728
41:31.420 --> 41:32.280
To Yun Li?

729
41:34.000 --> 41:34.780
No wonder you

730
41:34.780 --> 41:37.180
insisted on wearing my clothes yesterday.

731
41:37.800 --> 41:38.400
Then...

732
41:39.150 --> 41:39.900
am I

733
41:39.900 --> 41:41.300
interrupting you two?

734
41:41.300 --> 41:41.920
Nope.

735
41:43.090 --> 41:44.030
This is nice too.

736
41:48.510 --> 41:50.050
Is that a token of love

737
41:50.420 --> 41:51.800
in your hands?

738
41:53.230 --> 41:53.650
Mm.

739
41:54.110 --> 41:54.920
Let me see.

740
42:18.400 --> 42:20.330
Take her to the aquarium tomorrow.

741
42:20.860 --> 42:22.050
You can use my car.

742
42:24.720 --> 42:26.520
Remember to bring a little gift.

743
42:31.210 --> 42:32.140
[Wanna go to the aquarium tomorrow?]

744
42:32.140 --> 42:33.300
[(Not sent) Wanna go to the aquarium tomorrow?]
